### Create a return invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/return_invoices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "cashbox_id": 1,
  "cashbox_account_id": 1,
  "shift_id": 1,
  "inventory_id": 1,
  "year": 2026,
  "client_id": 1,
  "sales_invoice_id": 1,
  "discount": 0,
  "grand_total": 2500,
  "sub_total": 2500,
  "discounted_total": 2500
}

### Get a return invoice by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/return_invoices/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### List return invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/return_invoices?page_size=10&page_id=0
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
